    },
    {
      "id": "claim_def3dd36581543138d867b3eef5082cf",
      "statement": "WikiView is the per-wiki diagnostic surface and maps internal job columns to public fields: worker from claimed_by, attempts, progress, pages, size_bytes, push_result, error, and created_at/started_at/finished_at; claims are the only place attempts is incremented and neither retry nor stale-claim recovery resets it, so attempts counts user retries and reaped claims together.",
