    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f15d54bd48a64ec7a26faf53edb733b6",
      "statement": "The progress update doubles as the claim heartbeat: WorkerLoop._track reads the plan every WORKER_PROGRESS_SECONDS and calls store.heartbeat(), and a heartbeat answer with ok=False (lease reaped or completed elsewhere) or cancel=True sets the pipeline's cancel event so the running generation stops.",
