      "id": "claim_93a0153d96164c10994e7b9d9d034d22",
      "statement": "Every log line carries a UTC [HH:MM:SS] timestamp and is redacted before writing: the pipeline logger applies redact_text() to its messages and run_openwiki streams CLI stdout/stderr through the same filter with the job token as a known secret, masking URL credentials, Authorization/Private-Token header values and the token itself.",
