    {
      "id": "claim_53f88311ad7e4f49aed7f3d97680b64f",
      "statement": "push_result records the outcome of the optional push back to the source repository with one of four statuses: pushed and no_changes from publisher.publish_wiki, skipped when push.enabled is false, and failed written by WorkerLoop._run on publisher.PushError, which also sets status=failed and error=\"push failed: ...\" while leaving the already-packaged wiki.zip downloadable and retryable.",
