    {
      "id": "claim_ce83da21463b45a595834f1f51cc4cce",
      "statement": "The service's declared MVP limits are: no API authentication on any endpoint, a single-host SQLite queue on a shared volume that must be replaced by a Postgres backend with the same methods for multi-host scaling, private-repo personal access tokens persisted inside the source JSON column of the data volume outside logs and responses, push writing to the operator's repository with a write-capable token, and ALLOW_LOCAL_GIT defaulting to false because enabling it lets source.url read the container filesystem.",
